# Cookie 0: a round biscuit (kitchen_biscuit) with cocoa chips (kitchen_cocoa), 3.6 m across and 0.72 m high (60 times life size), a dome with a sharp-cut
# edge, lying on the worktop. Knee cover. Convex collider (a hull over 3 m becomes a mesh).
format 1
collider convex

